    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Fatima* and her mother have a bond closer than blood: a kidney. They are also the first participants in the Aga Khan University Hospital's new kidney transplant programme that aims to deliver a service of the highest quality in the private health sector, whilst taking care of patients in need.",
